<figure class="protocol-flow" aria-labelledby="protocol-flow-title">
  <figcaption id="protocol-flow-title">
    一次可恢复的命令往返
    <span>Gateway 与 Extension Bridge 各自维护序列并明确确认。</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="protocol-flow__lanes" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="protocol-flow__lane">Gateway</div>
    <div class="protocol-flow__lane protocol-flow__lane--right">
      Extension Bridge
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="protocol-flow__steps">
    <li data-direction="right">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">session.welcome</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">协商协议、公钥与恢复令牌</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="left">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">capability.report</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">声明可执行能力与风险等级</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="right">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">command.dispatch</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">绑定权限、截止时间与 Fencing Token</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="left">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">command.ack</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">确认接收；不代表执行成功</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="left">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">evidence.begin / chunk / complete</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">分块上传正文并校验完整摘要</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="right">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">evidence.ack</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">完整落盘后允许 Result 引用</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="left">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">command.result</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">引用已确认 Evidence，再发送最终状态</span>
    </li>
    <li data-direction="right">
      <span class="protocol-flow__type">result.ack</span>
      <span class="protocol-flow__detail">确认接收后，Bridge 才能清理正文</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="protocol-flow__alternative">
    文本说明：Gateway 先建立会话，Bridge 报告能力；命令携带最小权限与
    Fencing Token。Evidence 先完整落盘，Result 才能引用，结果经确认后进入终态。
  </p>
</figure>
